WEBVTT

00:01:29.246 --> 00:01:30.579
No? Sign up now.

00:01:30.621 --> 00:01:32.954
Are you contributing enough
to that 401(k)?

00:01:32.954 --> 00:01:35.496
No? Edit your contribution rate right now.

00:01:35.538 --> 00:01:37.496
Number three: if you haven't already,

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:39.621
talk to your significant
other about money.

00:01:39.621 --> 00:01:42.329
Get on the same page; it matters.

00:01:42.371 --> 00:01:44.621
Visit the link below
for a list of questions

00:01:44.621 --> 00:01:46.079
to help get you started.

00:01:46.079 --> 00:01:49.371
Number four: create
a singular savings goal.

00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:51.621
You can start by setting up
an automatic plan

00:01:51.621 --> 00:01:53.454
so that a portion of every paycheck

00:01:53.496 --> 00:01:55.579
goes directly into your savings account.

00:01:55.579 --> 00:01:58.913
Number five: start paying
off your debt every week,

00:01:58.913 --> 00:02:00.163
not just every month.